From d8bf178823bb6f2e97a9c4d9a8cd78d422f712e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:54:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] tla: check membership invariants; drop the symmetry
 reduction

Add invariants about membership and check them in MCetcdraft.cfg:
- LearnersVotersDisjointInv, ConfigEntryDisjointInv: no server is both a
  voter and a learner.
- KnowsPrevConfigCommittedInv: a server holding a config entry knows that
  the previous one is committed.
- AtMostOneUncommittedConfigInv: a leader has at most one uncommitted
  config entry.

Remove SYMMETRY from MCetcdraft.cfg. Permutations(Server) is not a
symmetry of the spec: InitServer, the order of BootstrapLog and the spare
servers make servers distinguishable, so the reduction could skip
reachable states.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tla/MCetcdraft.cfg |  7 +++++--
 tla/MCetcdraft.tla |  5 +++--
 tla/etcdraft.tla   | 25 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tla/MCetcdraft.cfg b/tla/MCetcdraft.cfg
index 31ad958..95f56d9 100644
--- a/tla/MCetcdraft.cfg
+++ b/tla/MCetcdraft.cfg
@@ -52,7 +52,6 @@ CONSTANTS
     AppendEntriesRequest    =   "AppendEntriesRequest"
     AppendEntriesResponse   =   "AppendEntriesResponse"
 
-SYMMETRY Symmetry
 VIEW View
 
 CHECK_DEADLOCK 
@@ -66,4 +65,8 @@ INVARIANTS
     QuorumLogInv
     MoreUpToDateCorrectInv
     LeaderCompletenessInv
-    CommittedIsDurableInv
\ No newline at end of file
+    CommittedIsDurableInv
+    LearnersVotersDisjointInv
+    ConfigEntryDisjointInv
+    KnowsPrevConfigCommittedInv
+    AtMostOneUncommittedConfigInv
diff --git a/tla/MCetcdraft.tla b/tla/MCetcdraft.tla
index 5302c2b..a4a7a4e 100644
--- a/tla/MCetcdraft.tla
+++ b/tla/MCetcdraft.tla
@@ -108,8 +108,9 @@ mc_etcdSpec ==
     /\ Init
     /\ [][NextDynamic]_vars
 
-\* Symmetry set over possible servers. May dangerous and is only enabled
-\* via the Symmetry option in cfg file.
+\* Symmetry set over possible servers. Not a symmetry of this spec:
+\* InitServer, the order of BootstrapLog (SetToSeq) and the spare servers
+\* make servers distinguishable, so do not use it as SYMMETRY.
 Symmetry == Permutations(Server)
 
 \* Include all variables in the view, which is similar to defining no view.
diff --git a/tla/etcdraft.tla b/tla/etcdraft.tla
index c6d83d4..20ef30d 100644
--- a/tla/etcdraft.tla
+++ b/tla/etcdraft.tla
@@ -920,6 +920,31 @@ CommittedIsDurableInv ==
     \A i \in Server :
         state[i] = Leader => commitIndex[i] <= Len(durableState[i].log)
 
+\* No server is both a voter and a learner in its config.
+LearnersVotersDisjointInv ==
+    \A i \in Server : GetConfig(i) \cap GetLearners(i) = {}
+
+\* No config entry makes a server both a voter and a learner.
+ConfigEntryDisjointInv ==
+    \A i \in Server : \A k \in 1..Len(log[i]) :
+        log[i][k].type = ConfigEntry => log[i][k].value.newconf \cap log[i][k].value.learners = {}
+
+\* A server holding a config entry knows that the previous config entry is
+\* committed. With one change at a time, this keeps the config a node
+\* campaigns on within one change of the latest config entry it holds.
+KnowsPrevConfigCommittedInv ==
+    \A i \in Server :
+        LET cfgIdx == {k \in 1..Len(log[i]) : log[i][k].type = ConfigEntry}
+            last == MaxOrZero(cfgIdx)
+            prev == MaxOrZero(cfgIdx \ {last})
+        IN prev <= commitIndex[i]
+
+\* A leader's log holds at most one config entry above its commit index
+\* (raft.go pendingConfIndex).
+AtMostOneUncommittedConfigInv ==
+    \A i \in Server : state[i] = Leader =>
+        Cardinality({k \in (commitIndex[i]+1)..Len(log[i]) : log[i][k].type = ConfigEntry}) <= 1
+
 -----
 
 
